<title>CANADA: Tarragon sets odd lot share buyback.</title>
<headline>Tarragon sets odd lot share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tarragon Oil &amp; Gas Ltd said it began an arrangement allowing holders of 99 or fewer common shares to sell their holdings to the company without incurring brokerage fees.</p>
<p>Tarragon said the voluntary selling arrangement was open to shareholders of record as of January 2 and would expire on March 31 unless extended.</p>
<p>((-- Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
